"v\": [[\"I'm trying to plan my weekend around a few things and I've lost track, so when is the Mostar again?\", \"Ah right, and who's coming to it? Just want to know who I'll bump into there.\", \"Different thing, I scribbled some ideas down a while back, could you pull up the notes in my Bonfire notebook?\"], [\"umm when is the, uh, the Mostar again?\", \"oh ok and who's, um, who's going to be at it?\", \"okay different thing, can you show me the notes in my, er, my Bonfire notebook?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0013\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out how packed next week gets before I agree to anything, so what's on tuesday?\", \"Actually, you know what, don't bother, I'll just check it properly later on myself.\", \"Oh, one thing though, the casket one, who else is going to be there? I want to know if I'll need to make small talk.\"], [\"whats on tuesday\", \"actually nvm dont bother\", \"the casket one tho, who else will be ther\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what the last thing I wrote in my journal was?\", \"Sorry, just a quick one before I forget: what's in the vault about meadowsweet?\", \"Also, could you please reserve a table at Pravmere Library for tonight?\"], [\"last journal entry?\", \"wait, quick one: meadowsweet?\", \"book table, Pravmere Library, tonight\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0015\", \"v\": [[\"open Astrophotography progress album\", \"just from last week\"], [\"Could you open the Astrophotography progress album for me, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me only the ones from last week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0016\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out whether I can squeeze in a lie-in, so what's in my calendar this weekend?\", \"Hmm, that's more than I expected. Could you narrow it down to anything about agent? That's the bit I actually care about.\"], [\"whats on my calendar this weekend\", \"just the agent stuff pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0018\", \"v\": [[\"Postex library account\"], [\"I need to renew a couple of books and can't remember my login, so could you pull up the Postex library account entry for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0019\", \"v\": [[\"I keep forgetting about this and really don't want to miss it, so when is my mosaic thing?\", \"Okay, separate thing. I'm trying to get everything together in one place, can you show me anything to do with Pravmere?\", \"Oh, can I see the password? I'm about to sit down and need to type it in.\", \"Thanks. And while we're at it, what have my pictures got on it? I feel like I took some once.\"], [\"Could you tell me when my mosaic thing is?\", \"On a different note, could you show me anything to do with Pravmere, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the password, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you also tell me what my pictures have on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0020\", \"v\": [[\"what mosaic stuff do i have\", \"tick off the third one pls\"], [\"Could you tell me what mosaic things I have?\", \"Would you mark the third one as done, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0021\", \"v\": [[\"umm do I have any to-dos about, uh, astrophotography?\", \"oh ok, can you tick off the ask one?\", \"okay um, different thing, does anyone owe me cash?\", \"right so I, uh, I phoned the first one, can you log that?\"], [\"astrophotography to-dos?\", \"tick off the ask one\", \"anyone owe me cash?\", \"phoned the first one, log it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0022\", \"v\": [[\"star the savings paperwork\", \"undelete the caddy photo\"], [\"Could you mark the savings paperwork with a star, please?\", \"Also, would you mind restoring the caddy photo I deleted?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0024\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me the travel mastercard card entry, please?\"], [\"umm can you pull up the, uh, the travel mastercard card entry?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0025\", \"v\": [[\"A friend asked if I'm free for it and I honestly can't remember, so when is the bonfire fair?\"], [\"when's the bonfire fair?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w04-0026\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me my photos from June, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on, could I see the shots from Cockpit first?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the June photos, could you tell me where the plank one was taken?\"], [\"umm can you pull up my pics from June?\", \"oh wait hang on, can I see the, uh, the shots from Cockpit?\", \"ok back to the June ones, um, the plank one, where was that taken?\"]]}","ttft_ms":24677,"type":"result","duration_ms":37348,"uuid":"c1d9be58-154d-47b9-9ac2-8a36cf580e3b","ttft_stream_ms":1429,"time_to_request_ms":190,"first_content_frame_ms":1430,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21847797,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278398362.133,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
